our hits, and when to push your luck Grenades, turrets and medstations, and when to spend them Keeping your Fireteam alive, because dead Agents stay dead The final stand against the MatriarchThen try it yourself: the demo is free, and part of Steam N","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:14:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034423","verified_at":"2026-10-23T03:32:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4871240-1846651706691394","game_id":"steam-4871240","kind":"announcement","title":"Nostos is in Steam Next Fest: play the free demo","summary":"The Nostos Group has a job for you.A derelict has gone dark. Your orders are simple: recover the Datacards, reach the evac, return with the salvage. Bring your Fireteam home too, if you can.What's in the demoThe demo gives you a fireteam and lets you experience the full game on Easy and Medium difficulty. Reveal the ship one card at a time, fight the Endoparasite swarm with a fistful of dice, scavenge grenades, Datacards, and medstations, and make your last stand against the Matriarch at the eva","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691394","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4871240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4871240":"2026-10-26T14:53:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4871240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:16Z"},"4954040":{"last_attempt_at":"20